<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paracelsus said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paracelsus said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Paracelsus Healthcare Corp to neutral from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 10-1/8 Wednesday.</p>
